DESCRIPTION:Join us for Hola\, Let's Learn Spanish! This interactive 
 program designed for children offers them a chance to practice their 
 conversation skills through engaging games\, fun activities\, and dynamic 
 conversation topics. This is a fun way to boost your child's confidence in 
 speaking Spanish.\n\nThis program is designed for children ages 5 and 
 up.\n\nRegistration is required.\n\n
