DESCRIPTION:Join Ms.Chelsea for some perler bead fun! Bring your own ideas 
 or use one of our patterns!\n\nThis program will be held on October 7\, 
 2026\, at 12:00 p.m. at North Regional Library. The address is 221 Milton 
