SUMMARY:Evening Family Storytime
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening storytime filled with stories\, songs\, 
 dancing\, and coloring! All ages are welcome. \n\nAll children under the 
 age of 11 must be accompanied by an adult.\n\nThis storytime is presented 
 by all of the Children's librarians at Main on a rotating basis.\nThe 
 schedule is typically:\n1st Wednesday of the month: Tina\n2nd Wednesday: 
 Laurel\n3rd Wednesday: Chloe\n4th Wednesday: Miles\n5th Wednesday: TBD\n
