SUMMARY:Banned Books Buttons and Magnets
DESCRIPTION:Banned Books Week was launched in response to surges in the 
 number of challenges to books in libraries\, bookstores\, and schools. The 
 annual event highlights the importance and value of free and open access to 
 information and literature. Each year it brings communities together to 
 fight censorship and to let individuals have the freedom to not only read 
 but to also seek and express ideas. \n\nIn honor of Banned Books Week\, 
 drop by the Makerlab to create buttons and magnets of your favorite banned 
 books!
LOCATION:MakerLab\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Dahlia Bullock":MAILTO:dahbullock@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-14288-17272419
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17272419
