SUMMARY:Witches Screening & Potion Making
DESCRIPTION:Are you ready to make a witch's brew? Join us in the Children's 
 Programming Room for a very spooky screening of The Witches\, one of the 
 all-time great movies that scared me when I was a kid. To make the scares 
 go down a little easier\, we will be crafting some wicked potions and 
 cursed brews together. Can't wait to see all you witches and wizards there! 
 \n\n \n\nRated PG for frightening situations and some suggestive themes
