SUMMARY:Small Business Finance and Lending
DESCRIPTION:Come learn more about small business financial literacy. We'll 
 discuss the different types of small businesses and their corresponding 
 documentation as well as managing the cash flow cycle of operating your 
 business. This session will also highlight common financial challenges new 
 entrepreneurs face and practical strategies to overcome them. Participants 
 will gain insights into budgeting\, forecasting\, and building sustainable 
 financial habits. Whether you're just starting out or looking to strengthen 
 your operations\, this workshop will equip you with tools to make confident 
 financial decisions.\n\nHosted by Fifth Third Bank at University Place
LOCATION:Adult Programming Room\, South Regional Library (4505 S. Alston Ave)
ORGANIZER;CN="Austin Daniels":MAILTO:ausdaniels@dconc.gov
