SUMMARY:Preschool Process Art: Spooky Skeletons
DESCRIPTION:Children ages 2-5 are invited to join Ms. Kristen and get 
 creative! Process art is child-directed and embraces the process of 
 creating\, rather than the end result. \n\nThis week\, we will make 
 spooooooky skeletons using craft paper\, cotton swabs\, and glue. 
 \n\nRegistration is appreciated\, but not required. Please dress for a 
 mess. Can't wait to see what you create! \n\n \n\nIf you have questions 
 about accessibility\, program stimulation levels\, and/or need disability 
 accommodations\, please contact us at (919) 560-8592.
