SUMMARY:Wallace & Gromit: The Curse of the Were-Rabbit & Pumpkin Decorating
DESCRIPTION:As we gear up for Halloween\, join us for a delightfully spooky 
 screening for the whole family! Get ready to enjoy this silly and sweet 
 family movie\, paired alongside with mini-pumpkin decorating. We prefer our 
 supplies to be on the exact side of things\, so please register if you want 
 to come watch and glam up some pumpkins with us!\n\n \n\nRated G for mild 
 scary sequences\n\n \n\n
