SUMMARY:Small Local Business Enterprise Program Information Session
DESCRIPTION:The City of Durham's Underutilized Business Compliance Division 
 is hosting an information session for the Small Local Business Enterprise  
 (SLBE) Program.\n\n \n\nThis program supports small businesses in Durham\, 
 Person\, Orange and Chatham counties (Durham MSA)\, and is specially 
 designed for businesses specializing in construction\, services (excluding 
