BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261020T220000Z
DTEND:20261020T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20261020T000000Z
SUMMARY:This Way Up: Identifying What Matters & Imagining Your Next Steps
DESCRIPTION:Some days you look up and wonder how you got here. The weeks 
 blur together. You're busy all the time\, but you're not sure it's adding 
 up to the life you actually want.\n\nThis session is a chance to stop and 
 take stock. We'll look at where your life feels full and where it needs 
 some attention. You'll get clear on a few things that matter most to you\, 
 and you'll build a real\, hopeful picture of where you'd like to be a year 
 from now. You’ll leave with one small step to start. \n\nBring a pen\, 
 some paper or your favorite journal\, and your real self.\n\nLed by Laura 
 Bey\, a National Board-Certified Health and Wellness Coach based in Durham.
LOCATION:Meeting Room #4347\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Alexandra Wurst":MAILTO:awurst@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-14288-17290447
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17290447
END:VEVENT
