SUMMARY:Magic Treehouse Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Join Jack\, Annie\, and our new Magic Tree House Book Club on 
 amazing adventures through time and space! We’ll explore a new book/topic 
 each session via crafts\, activities\, games\, and discussions. Suggested 
 for kids ages 4-8 (or any kid enjoying the MTH series). We will meet on the 
 third Wednesday of each month from 4 - 5 PM.\n\nBecause our September book 
 club had to be canceled\, we will meet to discuss Sunset of the Sabertooth 
 in October\, and will meet to discuss Midnight on the Moon in 
 November.\n\nThanks for your understanding! Registration is appreciated 
 :)\n\nIf you have questions about accessibility\, program stimulation 
