SUMMARY:Learn to Sew with Connecting with Threads
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to use a sewing machine with the non-profit 
 Connecting with Threads. This four week series of programs enables adults 
 to learn basic sewing skills and build their knowledge as they become 
 independent sewers. We will make useful items for you and your home. We 
 will discuss options for mending your own items of clothing or household 
 items. Bring your own sewing machine or use one of ours. The four programs 
 are scheduled for Wednesday evenings in October- October 7\, October 14\, 
 October 21\, and October 28. To complete all activities\, adults will need 
 to attend all four sessions. For adults and older teens.\n
