BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261023T134500Z
DTEND:20261023T141500Z
DTSTAMP:20261023T000000Z
SUMMARY:Book Babies
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for special bonding time with your little one 
 (aged 0-24 months)! At this lapsit-style storytime\, we will spend about 20 
 minutes engaging in structured learning through bounces\, rhymes\, songs\, 
 and books\, followed by 15-45 minutes of unstructured play and 
 socialization time.\n\nNote: A television is used during the first part of 
 the program (about 20 minutes) to display the words to the songs and rhymes 
 (to support adult engagement)\; there are no moving pictures. \n\nThis 
 program will be held on October 23\, 2026\, at 10:30 a.m. at North Regional 
 Library. The address is 221 Milton Rd. Durham\, NC 27712.\n\nOpen for all! 
 If you have any accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please 
 contact Chelsea at cromero@dconc.gov. We ask that all requests be made at 
 least three (3) business days prior to the event to ensure we can provide 
 the best accommodations possible. Thank you!
LOCATION:North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Chelsea Romero":MAILTO:cromero@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Story Time
UID:LibCal-14288-16650704
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/16650704
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261023T143000Z
DTEND:20261023T150000Z
DTSTAMP:20261023T000000Z
SUMMARY:Bragtown's Bilingual Storytime with Ms. Melanie!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Bilingual Storytime at the Bragtown Branch Library! 
 This engaging and interactive program is perfect for children and families 
 looking to enjoy stories\, songs\, and activities in both English and 
 Spanish.\n\nWhether you're fluent in both languages or just starting out\, 
 everyone is welcome to share in the fun and learning. Bilingual Storytime 
 is a wonderful way to build language skills\, make new friends\, and 
 celebrate our vibrant community.
LOCATION:Bragtown Branch Library (3200 Dearborn Dr)
ORGANIZER;CN="Melanie Jimenez":MAILTO:mrjimenez@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Bilingual, Story Time
UID:LibCal-14288-17233173
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17233173
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261023T143000Z
DTEND:20261023T150000Z
DTSTAMP:20261023T000000Z
SUMMARY:Preschool Storytime - 10/23
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Fridays for Preschool Storytime! Designed for 
 children ages 3–5\, this interactive storytime includes books\, songs\, 
 movement\, and a simple craft or coloring activity\, though children of all 
 ages are welcome to attend. Registration is encouraged to help us prepare 
 enough craft materials.\n\nPreschool Storytime will be led by Children’s 
 Librarians Tina and Miles. See below for the schedule of 
 presenters:\n\n\n	Friday\, September 4 – Miles\n	Friday\, September 11 
 – Tina\n	Friday\, September 18 – Scented Storytime\n	Friday\, September 
 25 – Miles\n	Friday\, October 2 – Tina\n	Friday\, October 9 – 
 Tina\n	Friday\, October 16 – Miles\n	Friday\, October 23 – 
 Tina\n	Friday\, October 30 – Miles\n	Friday\, November 6 – 
 Miles\n	Friday\, November 13  – Tina\n	Friday\, November 20 – 
 Miles\n	Friday\, December 4 – Tina\n	Friday\, December 11  – 
 Miles\n	Friday\, December 18 – Miles\n
LOCATION:Main Children's Programming Room\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Christina Economou":MAILTO:ceconomou@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Story Time
UID:LibCal-14288-17237056
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17237056
END:VEVENT
