SUMMARY:** CANCELED** Spanish Plus Language and Culture for Folks Over Fifty CANCELED**
DESCRIPTION:Have you taken some Spanish and want to practice? Interested in 
 exploring the culture of Spain and Latin America\, including music\, 
 dance\, and geography? Come learn with Oma\, an instructor with more than a 
 decade of experience teaching Spanish. Registration is required. Email 
 dpeterson@dconc.gov for more information. This program is open to all.
