SUMMARY:Social Stitchers
DESCRIPTION:Come join other needle & fiber art crafters to work on current 
 projects\, socialize\, and share tips. Open to all skill & experience 
 levels. Drop in for all or part of each session!\n\n***Please bring your 
 own materials***\n\nLimited supplies are available for beginners to get 
 started.
