SUMMARY:Create with Me: Halloween Candy Totes
DESCRIPTION:Come get messy and fret not because the library will handle all 
 the preparation and clean up! \n\nThis month\, we're creating our own tote 
 bags to hold all of your delicious candy! \n\n All supplies will be 
 provided. \n\n \n\nRegistration is required.
