SUMMARY:What Happens Next
DESCRIPTION:Not sure what to do after high school? Join us for an 
 information with Student U and Durham Technical Community College to learn 
 some of your options. They will discuss attending colleges and 
 universities\, obtaining certifications\, and pathways to learning 
 technical skills.
