SUMMARY:Maker Meet-Up at Lakewood Social
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a relaxed\, come-as-you-are afternoon of creativity 
 at Lakewood Social! Maker Meet-Up is a social crafting hangout where adults 
 can bring any project they are currently working on - knitting\, drawing\, 
 jewelry making\, LEGOs\, you name it. Don't have a craft you are currently 
 working on? No problem! Library staff will have supplies onsite to complete 
 a simple\, easy craft.\n\nBring a friend or meet new makers\, enjoy a 
 beverage and some food\, and unwind with a low-pressure creative community. 
 All skill levels are welcome\, and the atmosphere is all about having fun\, 
 connecting\, and making something with your hands.\n\nLook for our Rainbow 
 Pinwheel to know where our group is set-up. The Bookmobile will also be on 
 site and available for check-outs and returns.\n\nLakewood Social\n\n1920 
 Chapel Hill Rd\, Durham\, NC 27707
LOCATION:Bookmobile\, Offsite
