DESCRIPTION:Participate in the Royal Game of Chess! \n\nThe South Durham 
 Chess Club will meet on the fourth Saturdays of every month from 1:30-5:30 
 pm. All are welcome to attend regardless of age or skill level. Instruction 
 will be provided to beginners and novices. Sets and boards are provided\, 
