DESCRIPTION:Visit the Prop Stop to donate\, swap\, or take houseplant 
 cuttings. This is a community-driven way to share and grow 
 houseplants.\n\nThis is open to everyone. You do not have to leave a plant 
 to take one. For those leaving cuttings we ask that plant cuttings be 
 healthy and pest free.
