SUMMARY:Babies & Bubbles: Lapsit Storytime
DESCRIPTION:Babies (ages 0-24 months) and their caregivers are welcome to 
 join Ms. Natalie on Wednesday mornings for a lapsit storytime consisting of 
 bounces\, fingerplays\, songs\, stories\, open-ended play\, and 
 bubbles!\n\nNo registration required.\n\nIf you have questions about 
 accessibility\, program stimulation levels\, and/or need disability 
 accommodations\, please contact us at (919) 560-8592.
LOCATION:Southwest Meeting Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Natalie Perez":MAILTO:natperez@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Story Time
