SUMMARY:North Book Club
DESCRIPTION:\n\nCalling all fiction lovers!\n\nJoin us at North Regional 
 Library for convivial discussions on a variety of fiction titles. Library 
 copies of the month's book will be available on a first-come\, first-served 
 basis at the Information Desk starting the day of the previous 
 meeting.\n\nThis month's title is The Jackal's Mistress by Chris 
 Bohjalian.\n\n \n\nQuestions? Contact Emily at etobias@dconc.gov or 
 919-560-0140.\n\n \n\n \n\n
LOCATION:North Regional - Adult Programming Space\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Desiree Peterson":MAILTO:dpeterson@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Book Club
